/E (UNLIKE GENERAL HOSPITALS, OUR MODEL FOCUSES ON TWO HIGH-DEMAND DEPARTMENTS: INTERNAL MEDICINE AND ORTHOPEDICS. THE HOSPITAL OPERATES THREE DAYS A WEEK \(MONDAY, WEDNESDAY, AND FRIDAY\) FROM 9:00 AM TO 4:00 PM, WITH APPOINTMENTS ENDING AT 3:00 PM. EACH DOCTOR SEES A MAXIMUM OF 7 PATIENTS PER DAY, DEDICATING A FULL HOUR PER CONSULTATION FOR BETTER QUALITY CARE AND REDUCED FATIGUE.)
